      "hints": [
        "Because $AB=BC$ as vectors, $B$ is the midpoint of $AC$.",
        "Find $\\overrightarrow{OC}=2\\overrightarrow{OB}-\\overrightarrow{OA}$, then divide by its length."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "$\\overrightarrow{OC}=2(4,-4,2)-(2,-5,-2)=(6,-3,6)$.",
        "$|OC|=\\sqrt{6^2+(-3)^2+6^2}=9$, so the unit vector is $\\frac19(6\\mathbf{i}-3\\mathbf{j}+6\\mathbf{k})$."
      ]
    }
  ]
